  "task": "Our brand is facing a sudden surge of negative sentiment on Instagram and TikTok due to a controversial post from an influencer in our current campaign. I need to: 1) identify the exact problematic content and assess its impact, 2) review our campaign agreement with the influencer, 3) escalate the crisis and remove harmful content, and 4) blacklist the creator while finding replacement options."
